# .understandignore — patterns for files/dirs to exclude from analysis
# Syntax: same as .gitignore (globs, # comments, ! negation, trailing / for dirs)
# Lines below are suggestions — uncomment to activate.
# Use ! prefix to force-include something excluded by defaults.
#
# Built-in defaults (always excluded unless negated):
#   node_modules/, .git/, dist/, build/, obj/, *.lock, *.min.js, etc.
#

# --- From .gitignore (uncomment to exclude) ---

# *#
# **/*.rs.bk
# *.db
# *.db-journal
# *.db-shm
# *.db-wal
# *.duckdb
# *~
# .#*
# .*DS_Store
# .DS_Store
# .env
# .zed
# Cargo.lock
# cargo-flamegraph.trace
# debug
# dhat.*
# flamegraph*.svg
# license.html
# perf.data*
# profile.json*
# tmp

# --- Detected directories (uncomment to exclude) ---

# docs/

# --- Recommended: upstream generated/vendor data (not hand-written project logic) ---
# ~184 upstream Apache Kafka JSON protocol descriptors, read by nisshi-sans-io/build.rs
# to codegen wire-protocol structs. CLAUDE.md: "Do not manually edit generated files."
# Excluding avoids ~184 low-value data nodes; the generator itself (build.rs) is still analyzed.
nisshi-sans-io/message/*.json

